 🎯 Problem

Many people experience loneliness, stress, anxiety, or difficult emotions but may not know where to begin when looking for support.

Project Hope aims to bring several supportive tools together in one accessible platform instead of making users search through multiple resources.



 💡 Our Approach

Project Hope combines:

**AI Support + Journaling + Mood Tracking + Resources + Community**

into one simple web experience.

The project is intended as a **supportive wellness tool**, not a replacement for qualified mental-health professionals or emergency services.



